<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρ</span></b> , acc. to Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.22
		</span></i> an enclit. Conjunction (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπληρωματικὸς σύνδεσμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Trypho
				</span></i>
			 in Kenyon <i>Class. Texts</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.116
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ ταρ, οὔ ταρ</span>, to be
			read in place of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτ᾽ ἄρ᾽, οὔτ᾽
			ἄρ᾽</span>, as in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.65
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				93
			</span></i>; there is Ms. authority for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρ</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.761
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				18.182
			</span></i> one of the editions of <i><span class="en">
				Aristarch.
			</span></i> had <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρ</span>, the other <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαρ</span>, and codd. are divided: Cobet
			conjectured <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρ</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.61
			</span></i> (where his cj. is now confirmed by two codd.), and in other
			places, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Misc.Crit.</u>
				315
			</span></i>:—on the relation between <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὖταρ, αὖ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρ</span>,
				v.
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				254.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
